===Interpretation as dihedral group===

The symmetric group of degree three is isomorphic to the dihedral group <math>D_6</math> of degree three and order six. In the table below, we denote by <matH>a</matH> the generator of the cyclic subgroup of order three and by <math>x</math> one of the reflections.

